    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents an offer made by an enchanting table. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Bedrock stores every enchantment that selecting an offer applies rather than a single hinted enchantment. Enchantments in an offer must be entries obtained from Endstone&apos;s <ref refid="classendstone_1_1Enchantment" kindref="compound">Enchantment</ref> registry. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
